# LAV_results — pipeline output directory
# Mirrors the EV_results/ layout used by EmotiView.
#
# Layout produced at runtime:
#   LAV_results/
#     .bin/                     shared infrastructure (logs, HTML archive)
#     LAV_l1/                   per-country first-level results
#       LAV_001/                 Germany
#         plots/                 parquet output copies & vis
#         LAV_001_api_raw.parquet
#         LAV_001_normalized.parquet
#         LAV_001_displacement.parquet
#         LAV_001_trends.parquet
#         LAV_001.log.parquet    live execution log
#       LAV_002/  …
#     LAV_l2/                   cross-country group-level results
#       LAV_volt_report.parquet
#       LAV_displacement_summary.parquet
#       LAV_trends_summary.parquet
#       LAV_l2.log.parquet
